Following aspects have been considered:
(1) Investigation is over and charge-sheet has been filed; (2) The applicant came in the second part of offence alongwith the key and role attributed to the present applicant is that he was a by-stander and has not participated in the offence and was not present at the time when actually the offence took place;
(3) Applicant is behind the bar since 03.12.2023; (4) There is nothing to be recovered or discovered from the applicant;
(5) Co-accused having similar or graver role than that of the present applicant have been considered and therefore, in view of decision of this Court in the case of Ramesh Batubhai Dabhi vs. State of Gujarat reported in 2011 (3) GLR 1150, applicant is Mirjad Akbarbhai Alias Hakubha Khiyani vs State Of Gujarat on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/84855271/
